cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data model or dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "chublets-wikibase-demo: static demonstration of the chublets.software Wikibase model"
abstract: >-
  The data model of the chublets.software Wikibase and its software entries,
  kept as CSV tables and rendered with wikibase-static as a static, read-only
  site with RDF export and an in-browser SPARQL page.
type: dataset
